      "description": "Japan can be overwhelming to plan - unless you have the right guide!  So you have come to the right place. Jason has done all the hard work for you, and it's all here for you. Japan is the ultimate travel destination – a mecca of culture, food, design and amazing experiences. It can be difficult to navigate as it’s unlike anywhere else you have ever been. \n\nJason Japan is your ultimate Japan Travel Guide app created by much loved Australian stylist, designer and author Jason Grant. After he first visited Japan and immediately fell in love with the people and the places, he began to compile a list of his discoveries, recommendations from friends and his own exploration. \n\nJason Japan has been designed as a comprehensive edit and to make things much easier when you travel to Japan. The app will evolve and grow. We will always be sharing the best of Japan.\n\nThe guide features insider tips through his lens as a multi hyphenate creative. Jason Japan shares the best Japan has to offer – packed full of tips, travel hacks, recommendations and more. \n\nIt includes useful information to know before you travel and will help you plan ahead. Designed to be user friendly and great on the go – with easy to navigate categories of must see places, including where to eat, drink, shop, stay, plus a heap of other cool things to see and do – complete with maps and directions.\n\nFocusing on Tokyo, Kyoto and Osaka, it also encourages you to explore like a local and head away from the crowds. Yes there are must see tourist spots but there is so much more to see. Step off the main streets into hidden lanes and side streets to discover hidden gems – sometimes getting lost is when you find the best things.\n\nThis app has been created to be your best Japan travel companion in the palm of your hand.",
